AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000315> "An organisation role is a role of an aggregate of people that has a collective goal and a set of organisation rules.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000315> "organisation role"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000315> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000023>)

