AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000340> "A project is a process to achieve a specified goal that is unique in the sum of its conditions like its goal, time and cost budget and its organisation.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000340> "project"@en)
