AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000350> "A quantity value is an information content entity defined by a numeral together with a unit of measurement to quantify an entity."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000350> "quantity value"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000350> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000030>)
