AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020185> "A copyright licence is a licence that states the ownership and contractually sets the rights and obligations to use, copy, and distribute a creative work.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020185> "copyright licence"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020185> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020015>)

