AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140009> "A sponsor is an agent that supports a person, organisation, or project by giving money, allowance of kind, services or other help.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140009> "sponsor"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140009> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000051>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140043> (time stamp)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140043> "A time stamp is a data descriptor that is used to describe either a temporal region or a data item that is related to a temporal region, e.g. a time stamped measurement datum. If the time stamp refers to a time step/one-dimensional temporal region, the indication of a time stamp alignment is required")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140043> "time stamp"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140043> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000119>)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140043> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000136> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000008>))
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140043> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000136> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000582>))

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140044> (time stamp alignment)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140044> "A time stamp alignment is a data descriptor that indicates the position of a time stamp in a time step.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140044> "time stamp alignment"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140044> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000119>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00340062> (quantity)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00340062> "A quantity is a quality of a material entity where the magnitude  of the quality can be quantified via a quantity value, which means that it can be expressed as a number and a unit.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00340062> "quantity"@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00340062> ObjectIntersectionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000019> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00140002> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000350>)))
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00340062> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000019>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00360020> (region of relevance)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00360020> "A region of relevance is a spatial region that is used in a study or analysis, or is part of spatial planning."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00360020> "region of relevance"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00360020> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000006>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00360021> (study region role)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00360021> "A study region role is a role of a region of relevance that is under investigation and consists entirely of one or more subregions."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00360021> "study region role"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00360021> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000023>)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00360021> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000052> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00360020>))

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00360022> (considered region role)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00360022> "A considered region role is the role of a region of relevance that is used in an analysis."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00360022> "considered region role"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00360022> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000023>)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00360022> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000052> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00360020>))

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390002> (wind characteristics determination method)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390002> "Wind characteristics determination method is a methodology with the goal to understand the specific wind characteristics of a predefined region, encompassing data acquisition, modelling, and analytical procedures.
Wind characteristics include speed, direction, frequency, turbulence, and seasonal or diurnal patterns.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390002> "wind characteristics determination method"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390002> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020166>)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390002> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390004>))
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390002> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051> ObjectUnionOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390003> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390005> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390014> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390015> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390016> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390017>)))

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390003> (data preparation)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390003> "Data preparation is an action specification that describes the steps the bearer takes to acquire raw data and how this data is cleaned, transformed, and structured for subsequent analysis. So it includes the acquisition and pre-processing of data.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390003> "data preparation"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390003> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390035>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390004> (determined wind characteristics)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390004> "Determined wind characteristics is an object specification that defines the goal of a methodology as a state of understanding the specific wind characteristics of a predefined region.
Wind characteristics include speed, direction, frequency, turbulence, and seasonal or diurnal patterns.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390004> "determined wind characteristics"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390004> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000005>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390005> (wind speed calculation)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390005> "Wind speed calculation is an action specification that describes how wind speed at the hub height of a wind turbine is inferred from measurements taken at a different height. It is extrapolated vertically to the hub height.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390005> "wind speed calculation"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390005> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390035>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390007> (wind characteristics determination process)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390007> "Wind characteristics determination process is a process that follows a determination methodology for wind characteristics to gain knowledge of the specific wind characteristics of a predefined region.
Wind characteristics include speed, direction, frequency, turbulence, and seasonal or diurnal patterns.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390007> "wind characteristics determination process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390007> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000015>)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390007> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390026> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390002>))

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390014> (air density adjustment)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390014> "Air density adjustment is an action specification that describes how variations in air density due to changes in altitude, temperature, and pressure are incorporated into the wind resource calculations.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390014> "air density adjustment"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390014> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390035>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390015> (wind speed frequency analysis)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390015> "Wind speed frequency analysis is an action specification that describes the process of calculating the frequency of different wind speed intervals over a set period giving a wind speed frequency distribution.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390015> "wind speed frequency analysis"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390015> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390035>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390016> (wind variability identification)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390016> "Wind variability identification is an action specification that describes the process of identifying variations in wind characteristics across temporal scales.
Wind characteristics include speed, direction, frequency, turbulence, and seasonal or diurnal patterns.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390016> "wind variability identification"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390016> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390035>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390017> (wind power density calculation)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390017> "Wind power density calculation is an action specification that describes how wind power density (WPD) is calculated to estimate the theoretical wind power potential based on wind speed and air density.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390017> "wind power density calculation"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390017> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390035>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390027> (improve spatial resolution)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390027> "Improve spatial resolution is an action specification that describes the process of increasing the spatial resolution of wind data across a region to provide finer detail for wind resource assessment. This is done by horizontal interpolation.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390027> "improve spatial resolution"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390027> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390036>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390028> (select exclusion criteria)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390028> "Select exclusion criteria is an action specification that describes the process of defining physical, environmental, and regulatory criteria that exclude areas from wind farm development, along with the application of buffer zones.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390028> "select exclusion criteria"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390028> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390036>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390029> (prepare exclusion criteria datasets)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390029> "Prepare exclusion criteria datasets is an action specification that describes the steps involved in obtaining and preparing datasets that represent exclusion zones for wind farm development, based on predefined criteria. That includes acquiring and processing the data.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390029> "prepare exclusion criteria datasets"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390029> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390036>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390030> (run multi-criteria decision analysis)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390030> "Run multi-criteria secision analysis is an action specification that describes how a multi-criteria decision analysis (MCDA) method is applied to areas where exclusions are not absolute (soft exclusion criteria), allowing for weighted decision-making.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390030> "run multi-criteria decision analysis"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390030> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390036>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390031> (determine development area)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390031> "Determine development area is an action specification that describes the identification of potential areas where wind farm development is feasible, by iteratively excluding non-available areas based on the processed data and exclusion criteria.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390031> "determine development area"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390031> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390036>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390032> (determine geographical potential)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390032> "Determine geographical potential is an action specification that describes the calculation of the total geographical area available for wind farm development after applying exclusion criteria and considering spatial constraints.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390032> "determine geographical potential"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390032> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390036>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390033> (determined wind farm area)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390033> "Determined wind farm area is an object specification that defines the goal of a methodology as a state of understanding the available area for wind farm development.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390033> "determined wind farm area"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390033> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000005>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390034> (wind farm area determination method)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390034> "Wind farm area determination method is a methodology with the goal of identifying and quantifying the area suitable for wind farm development, based on topographical, environmental, and regulatory constraints.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390034> "wind farm area determination method"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390034> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020166>)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390034> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390033>))
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390034> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051> ObjectUnionOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390027> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390028> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390029> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390030> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390031> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390032>)))

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390035> (action specification for wind characteristics)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390035> "Action specification for wind characteristics is an action specification that deals with wind characteristics.
Wind characteristics include speed, direction, frequency, turbulence, and seasonal or diurnal patterns.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390035> "action specification for wind characteristics"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390035> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000007>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390036> (action specification for wind farm development area)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390036> "Action specification for wind farm development area is an action specification that deals with available area for wind farm development.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390036> "action specification for wind farm development area"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390036> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000007>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390037> (wind farm area determination process)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390037> "Wind farm area determination process is a process that follows a determination methodology for available area to gain knowledge of the available area for wind farm development.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390037> "wind farm area determination process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390037> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000015>)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390037> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390026> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390034>))

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390038> (action specification for the technical wind potential)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390038> "Action specification for the technical wind potential of the available area is an action specification that deals with the technical wind potential of the available area.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390038> "action specification for the technical wind potential"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390038> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000007>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390039> (select appropriate turbine types)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390039> "Select appropriate turbine types is an action specification that describes the process of choosing wind turbine models based on site-specific wind characteristics, hub height, and rotor diameter.
Wind characteristics include speed, direction, frequency, turbulence, and seasonal or diurnal patterns.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390039> "select appropriate turbine types"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390039> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390038>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390040> (place turbines within area)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390040> "Place turbines within area is an action specification that describes the definition of the spatial arrangement of wind turbines within the designated area, ensuring optimal positioning based on site characteristics and layout constraints.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390040> "place turbines within area"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390040> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390038>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390041> (account for wake losses)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390041> "Account for wake losses is an action specification that describes the inclusion of losses due to wind turbine wake effects, which reduce wind speed and energy yield behind turbines.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390041> "account for wake losses"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390041> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390038>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390042> (determine annual energy yield)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390042> "Determine annual energy yield is an action specification that describes how a turbine's power curve is combined with the wind speed distribution to calculate the expected annual energy production.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390042> "determine annual energy yield"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390042> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390038>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390043> (determine capacity factor)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390043> "Determine capacity factor is an action specification that describes the calculation of the capacity factor (CF), which represents the ratio of actual energy output to the maximum possible output over a given time period.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390043> "determine capacity factor"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390043> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390038>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390044> (calculate technical potential)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390044> "Calculate technical potential is an action specification that describes how the total energy production capability of the available area is determined, factoring in turbine placement, capacity density, and wake losses.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390044> "calculate technical potential"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390044> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390038>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390045> (determined wind potential)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390045> "Determined wind potential is an object specification that defines the goal of a methodology as a state of understanding the technical wind potential of the available area.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390045> "determined wind potential"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390045> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000005>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390046> (wind potential determination method)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390046> "Wind potential determination method is a methodology with the goal of calculating the technical wind energy potential within the identified suitable area, considering turbine technology, placement, and energy yield factors.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390046> "wind potential determination method"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390046> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020166>)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390046> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390045>))
