# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390049> (determine wind turbine lifetime)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390049> "Determine wind turbine lifetime is an action specification that describes the process of estimating the operational lifespan of a wind turbine, based on design and site-specific conditions.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390049> "determine wind turbine lifetime"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390049> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390048>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390050> (determine capital expenditures)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390050> "Determine capital expenditures is an action specification that describes the calculation of capital expenditures (CAPEX) required for the installation of wind turbines and associated infrastructure.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390050> "determine capital expenditures"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390050> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390048>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390051> (determine operational expenditures)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390051> "Determine operational expenditures is an action specification that describes the estimation of ongoing operational expenditures (OPEX) for wind turbines, including routine maintenance and operational management. These include operating and maintenance costs.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390051> "determine operational expenditures"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390051> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390048>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390052> (determine discount and interest rate)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390052> "Determine discount and interest rate is an action specification that describes the selection of financial discount and interest rates, which are used in the economic analysis to account for the time value of money.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390052> "determine discount and interest rate"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390052> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390048>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390053> (calculate levelised cost of electricity)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390053> "Calculate levelised cost of electricity is an action specification that describes the computation of the levelised cost of electricity (LCOE) either for individual turbines or for sub-regions within the study area by applying a cost model based on the previously calculated economic parameters and the capacity factors.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390053> "calculate levelised cost of electricity"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390053> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390048>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390054> (calculate economic potential)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390054> "Calculate economic potential is an action specification that describes the determination of the total economic potential of the available area under a maximum threshold LCOE value.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390054> "calculate economic potential"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390054> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390048>)

