AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390055> "determined techno-economic potential"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390055> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000005>)

# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390056> (techno-economic potential determination method)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390056> "Techno-economic potential determination method is a methodology with the goal of assessing the economic viability of wind energy projects within the available area, based on the technical potential and incorporating cost factors and economic metrics.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390056> "techno-economic potential determination method"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390056> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020166>)
