AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390059> "Apply socio-economic constraints for assessment of potential is an action specification that describes the process of integrating non-technical factors, such as social acceptance, land use regulations, or market conditions, into the potential assessment.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390059> "apply socio-economic constraints for assessment of potential"@en)
