AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390061> "determined feasible potential"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00390061> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000005>)

